<span id="Answers"></span><div mt-section-origin="Courses/Howard_University/General_Chemistry:_An_Atoms_First_Approach/Unit_4:__Thermochemistry/09:_Thermochemistry/Chapter_9.06:_Calorimetry" class="mt-section"><span id="Answers"></span><h3 class="title" id="Answers-21858">Answers</h3>

